ht" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;1,154&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="35" style="width: 26.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" style="width: 1in; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;1,150 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 15pt"&gt;&lt;td width="120" style="width: 1.25in; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Customer C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="19" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="114" style="width: 85.35pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;608&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="35" style="width: 26.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" style="width: 1in; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;687 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 15pt"&gt;&lt;td width="120" style="width: 1.25in; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Customer D&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="19" valign="bottom" style="width: 14.15pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 11pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="114" style="width: 85.35pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;989&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="35" style="width: 26.5pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="96" style="width: 1in; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;914 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;In addition to the concentration of revenue risk by customers discussed above, Tiger has a customer with outstanding accounts receivable greater than 10% from all customers. This customer has transportation receivable of $0.9 million as of December 31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.25in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;14.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Fair Value Measurement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The carrying amounts of accounts receivable and accounts payable approximate their fair value.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.25in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;15.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The FERC's Revised Policy Statement on Treatment of Income Taxes, Docket No. PL17-1, states that it no longer permits master limited partnerships including a company that does not pay taxes itself and is owned by a master limited partnership, to recover an income tax allowance in their cost of service. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.25in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;16.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Taxes, Other Than on Income&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Taxes, other than on income primarily consist of ad valorem tax paid on the assessed value of Tiger's natural gas transmission lines based on fixed rates established by the applicable state or local taxing authorities. Ad valorem taxes are generally based on assessed property value at the beginning of each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 style="margin: 12pt 0 12pt 0.25in; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="text-decoration: none"&gt;&lt;span&gt;17.&lt;span style="font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Commitments and Contingencies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Tiger &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;is subject to proceedings, lawsuits and other claims related to environmental and other matters.Accounting for contingencies requires significant judgment by management regarding the estimated probabilities and ranges of exposure to potential liability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1 style="margin: 6pt 0 0; line-height: 12pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: bold"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;NOTE C - RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The following table provides a summary of affiliate transactions for the periods presented:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="553" style="width: 627px; max-width: 1802.5px; height: 212px" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 11.7371%"&gt;&lt;td width="252" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt; width: 53.4687%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="63" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt; width: 3.5533%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="238" colspan="3" style="border-top: none; border-right: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 16.5pt; width: 42.978%"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;Years Ended December 31,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 11.7371%"&gt;&lt;td width="252" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt; width: 53.4687%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="63" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt; width: 3.5533%"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&am