 sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="110" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt; width: 19.797%"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;1,667&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="19" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt; width: 3.38409%"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="110" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt; width: 19.797%"&gt;   &lt;p align="right" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;417&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;ol start="1" style="margin-bottom: 0"&gt;&lt;li style="margin-left: -0.25in; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Transportation and operational sales related revenue from ETC Marketing Ltd. and Trunkline Gas Company, LLC (&amp;quot;TGC&amp;quot;), both indirect wholly-owned subsidiaries of Energy Transfer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-left: -0.25in; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Corporate charges and shared services provided by Energy Transfer and its subsidiaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-left: -0.25in; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Transportation and compression expenses from TGC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style="margin-left: -0.25in; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Compressor equipmentparts and related services provided by SEC Energy Products &amp;amp; Services, L.P., an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Energy Transfer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Accounts receivable from and accounts payable to associated companies primarily relates to cash management activity, transportation of natural gas and various operating and administrative services provided by Energy Transfer and its subsidiaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;Tiger has transportation and exchange gas receivables and payables with associated companies as a result of differences in volumes of gas received and delivered for those associated companies. The imbalances are settled based on the operator balancing agreements that Tiger has with those associated companies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 12pt 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;The following table sets forth the balances with associated companies within transportation and exchange gas payables reflected in Miscellaneous current and accrued liabilities, Account 242, on the balance sheet:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="582" style="width: 436.5pt" class="e-rte-paste-table"&gt;  &lt;tr style="height: 15pt"&gt;&lt;td width="239" style="width: 179pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="93" style="width: 70pt; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;   &lt;/td&gt;&lt;td width="250" colspan="3" style="width: 187.5pt; border-top: none; border-right: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); border-left: none; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 1); padding: 0 5.4pt; height: 15pt"&gt;   &lt;p align="center" style="margin: 0; font-size: 12pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;, sans-serif; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); text-decoration: inherit"&gt;December 31,&lt;/span&gt